WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.640
My name's Lena Grisky,
and I go to the best

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:04.616
ballet school in the world.

00:00:04.616 --> 00:00:05.710
But, I have a secret.

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:07.650
- It's magic.

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:09.690
I'm a time traveler
from 1905, and

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:11.430
my boyfriend Henry
is doing everything

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:12.480
he can to get me home.

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:13.350
- This is incredible.

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:14.290
- You've got to get current.

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:15.660
- I'm getting current.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.160
Oh, she's amazing.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:21.980
You don't know who
you're messing with.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.930
The time collectors,
they're after me.

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:27.960
Whatever time you're in, dance
like your life depends on it.

